[heading]Weightless Ammo[/heading]

Ammo weighs 0. Grab as much as you want and it never counts against your encumbrance. Only ammo changes, so everything else keeps its normal weight.

Good for loot goblins who scoop up every box, and for stocking up before a heavy fight where every bullet counts.

The mod zeroes the weight at its source, so both the encumbrance total and the inventory weight display read 0.

[line]

[heading]Install[/heading]

[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelaststandaftermath/mods/1]BepInEx for The Last Stand: Aftermath[/url]. Start the game once so BepInEx finishes setup, then quit.
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path examples:
[list]
[*]Steam: C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\WeightlessAmmo.dll
[*]Epic: C:\Program Files\Epic Games\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\WeightlessAmmo.dll
[/list]
[*]Start the game. Ammo now weighs 0 in your inventory.
[/list]

Not working? Open BepInEx\LogOutput.log and look for the Weightless Ammo loaded line.

[heading]Uninstall[/heading]

Delete WeightlessAmmo.dll from the BepInEx\plugins folder.

[line]

